* $loinc-ontology-loinc#9824-4
// Observables of the LOINC Ontology module without a LOINC code (2)
* $sct-loinc-ontology#363891000119100 "Identification of bacteria in sputum by culture (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#364061000119103 "Presence of Streptococcus agalactiae in genital system by organism specific culture (observable entity)"
// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = << 703725008 |Culture technique (qualifier value)|"
